    "detailed_description": "So many zombies and so few bullets! Bring on the next wave! What's coming next?<br />\r\n<br />\r\nIn this virtual reality shooting game, the one with the best aim is the one who'll live the longest. If you want to win, just follow these rules:<br />\r\n<br />\r\n- Survive waves of zombies and strange creatures, each more powerful... and larger!<br />\r\n- Remember, aim for the head.<br />\r\n- Whenever you can, get on top of your car, into a container... even a tomb... stay out of their reach!<br />\r\n- And above all, don't run out of bullets! You'll have to move to find ammo... if they let you.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nVRSUS DEAD is a casual virtual reality game where you can try to defeat all waves of zombies and monsters in different scenarios, earn a few achievements, or simply spend some time blasting away virtual shots. The choice is yours!",
    "about_the_game": "So many zombies and so few bullets! Bring on the next wave! What's coming next?<br />\r\n<br />\r\nIn this virtual reality shooting game, the one with the best aim is the one who'll live the longest. If you want to win, just follow these rules:<br />\r\n<br />\r\n- Survive waves of zombies and strange creatures, each more powerful... and larger!<br />\r\n- Remember, aim for the head.<br />\r\n- Whenever you can, get on top of your car, into a container... even a tomb... stay out of their reach!<br />\r\n- And above all, don't run out of bullets! You'll have to move to find ammo... if they let you.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nVRSUS DEAD is a casual virtual reality game where you can try to defeat all waves of zombies and monsters in different scenarios, earn a few achievements, or simply spend some time blasting away virtual shots. The choice is yours!",
